Kenny Loggins and Jim Messina were a singer-songwriter duo.

587
00:25:54.920 --> 00:25:55.060
Okay.

588
00:25:55.060 --> 00:25:56.360
They had tons of hits.

589
00:25:56.360 --> 00:25:57.120
You probably know.

590
00:25:57.320 --> 00:25:58.600
I mean, I know you know them.

591
00:25:58.700 --> 00:26:01.240
The song, Danny's song.

592
00:26:01.460 --> 00:26:02.200
Oh, my gosh.

593
00:26:02.240 --> 00:26:08.580
I'm a horrible singer, but it's like, even though we ain't got money, I'm so in love with you, honey.

594
00:26:08.920 --> 00:26:09.720
Oh, I love that song.

595
00:26:09.720 --> 00:26:10.540
Okay, that one.

596
00:26:10.680 --> 00:26:12.000
That's Loggins and Messina.

597
00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:13.180
That's Loggins and Messina.

598
00:26:13.400 --> 00:26:16.560
Also, your mama don't dance, and your daddy don't rock and roll.

599
00:26:16.740 --> 00:26:17.960
That's Loggins and Messina.

600
00:26:18.140 --> 00:26:19.080
They had so many hits.

601
00:26:19.080 --> 00:26:19.920
Oh, I love them.

602
00:26:20.200 --> 00:26:23.560
