All of a sudden, there's this front reception standoff between Andy and Pam, and Kelly's freaking out.

643
00:28:13.260 --> 00:28:14.540
She's like, someone just answer it.

644
00:28:14.540 --> 00:28:16.200
Neither of them want to budge.

