There was a Pam-deleted talking head that would have gone here, and I want to read it to you.

646
00:28:20.440 --> 00:28:20.780
Please.

647
00:28:21.140 --> 00:28:22.160
I remember it.

648
00:28:22.620 --> 00:28:23.740
Here's what Pam said.

649
00:28:24.080 --> 00:28:26.080
I just got back from maternity leave.

650
00:28:26.160 --> 00:28:28.340
I can't let them make me the receptioniSt.

651
