Were there any candy bag alts?

684
00:30:35.800 --> 00:30:37.220
I went to the candy bag.

685
00:30:37.420 --> 00:30:38.160
I did, too.

686
00:30:38.460 --> 00:30:39.620
I didn't see any.

687
00:30:39.740 --> 00:30:40.540
No alts.

688
00:30:40.700 --> 00:30:43.420
And this line was scripted exactly the way he said it.

689
00:30:43.520 --> 00:30:43.800
Yes.

690
