But it did make me want to know if Stanley had any other mottos.

691
00:30:48.300 --> 00:30:53.800
I wish that there was, like, just a writer's pitch sheet of Stanley mottos.

692
00:30:54.280 --> 00:30:55.880
I'm sure it exists somewhere.

693
00:30:55.880 --> 00:30:59.940
I was actually going to ask you about the show Bible, if it said anything in the show Bible.

694
00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:03.860
If there was a page called Stanley's Mottos, I believe there is not.

695
00:31:04.500 --> 00:31:05.960
I wish there was.

696
00:31:06.580 --> 00:31:08.420
Guess who else is at this conference?

697
00:31:08.960 --> 00:31:10.560
The Pac-Man is back.

698
00:31:11.000 --> 00:31:14.320
Jim and Dwight tried to get him fired, but he landed on his feet in Florida.

699
00:31:14.320 --> 00:31:16.800
Yeah, he's got nine lives and a nine-inch.

700
00:31:17.220 --> 00:31:18.680
Nine inches of other things.

701
00:31:18.880 --> 00:31:19.060
Yep.

702
00:31:19.220 --> 00:31:19.460
Mm-hmm.

703
00:31:20.300 --> 00:31:26.920
Now we get to introduce Nellie Bertram, one of my favorite introductions ever.

704
00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:31.340
I love how she just selects Ryan and just starts whispering to him.

705
00:31:31.440 --> 00:31:33.040
And also, Ryan doesn't question it.

706
00:31:33.200 --> 00:31:33.420
I know.

707
00:31:33.420 --> 00:31:35.800
He just starts saying what she's telling him to say.

708
00:31:35.960 --> 00:31:36.360
Yes.

709
00:31:36.360 --> 00:31:38.160
What does she get Ryan to say?

710
00:31:38.160 --> 00:31:43.020
She says, psst, say, so who's leading this thing anyway?

711
00:31:44.860 --> 00:31:46.920
Psst, say, I can't wait to meet him.

712
00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:48.120
Yes.

713
00:31:48.380 --> 00:31:50.720
And then she stands up and says, him, you say?

714
00:31:50.880 --> 00:31:52.240
Don't think a woman could be a leader?

715
00:31:52.560 --> 00:31:54.220
You poor simple boy.

716
00:31:55.320 --> 00:31:55.840
Yes.

717
00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:57.700
And then she launches into a speech.

718
