And I want to ask you, Angela, if I'm ever asked to do like a commencement speech at my college or a college,

719
00:32:06.220 --> 00:32:09.000
can I start my speech like this?

720
00:32:09.480 --> 00:32:10.580
Can I do this?

721
00:32:11.340 --> 00:32:13.020
Expected a man, did you?

722
00:32:13.680 --> 00:32:16.360
Strong, powerful, huge, whopping penis?

723
00:32:16.740 --> 00:32:20.940
Well, sorry to disappoint, but my huge, whopping penis is right here.

724
00:32:21.100 --> 00:32:22.520
Then I point to my brain.

725
00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:24.620
And I'm not afraid to use it.

726
00:32:24.740 --> 00:32:28.100
So stop looking at my breasts and start looking at my penis.

727
00:32:29.120 --> 00:32:30.720
Can I start it that way?

728
00:32:30.860 --> 00:32:32.100
Will people get it?

729
00:32:34.240 --> 00:32:35.620
That would be amazing.

730
00:32:35.900 --> 00:32:36.500
Can I?

731
00:32:36.660 --> 00:32:37.840
I really want to know.

732
00:32:37.980 --> 00:32:38.860
I want you to do it.

733
00:32:39.500 --> 00:32:45.220
There is going to be an event, and I'm going to start it that way, and we'll see how it goes.

734
00:32:45.720 --> 00:32:49.740
There's going to be a whole ton of people that don't get it and think you've lost it.

735
00:32:49.760 --> 00:32:50.140
I know.

736
00:32:50.300 --> 00:32:53.320
And then there'll be like a few people in the corner that are like, woohoo!

737
00:32:54.580 --> 00:32:56.120
Season eight, tell us.

738
00:32:57.960 --> 00:33:00.400
So Nellie, yes, is now running the meeting.

739
00:33:00.640 --> 00:33:07.760
She's going to explain the origin of this project, which is that she interviewed to be the potential branch manager in Scranton.

740
